{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05378","headline":"奉和圣制送张说上集贤学士赐宴 · 韦述","name":"奉和圣制送张说上集贤学士赐宴","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"修文中禁啓，改字令名加。\n台座徵人杰，书坊应国华。\n赋诗开广宴，赐酒酌流霞。\n云散明金阙，池开照玉沙。\n掖垣留宿鸟，温树落余花。\n谬此天光及，衔恩醉日斜。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦述","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_05378.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_05378","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}